<title>USA: Aames opens 2.1 mln common offer at $51/shr.</title>
<headline>Aames opens 2.1 mln common offer at $51/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aames Financial Corp said Friday it has begun offering of 2.1 million shares of its common stock at $51 per share.</p>
<p>Aames is selling all the shares. The home equity lending company said it has about 15.8 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>NatWest Securities Ltd, Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc, Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc and Smith Barney Inc are underwriting the offering. The underwriters have exercised their over-allotment option to buy 315,000 more shares, Aames said.</p>
</text>
